gy and the 119,704,000 Environment Ministry of Transport 169,867,000 Ministry of Rural Development 175,429,000 Ministry of Energy, Communications 16,630,000 and Multimedia Ministry of Entrepreneur Development 468,281,000 Ministry of Foreign Affairs 137,948,000 TOTAL 18,429,403,000"
